padding

:

px

px

;

/* mobile: compact */

}

}

On a 1920px monitor you get 100px top/bottom padding. On a 375px iPhone it drops to 20px. Same element, two behaviors, zero JavaScript.

#

Navigation collapse for tablet and mobile

